  "cited_article_id": "configure-provider-calendar",
  "reply": "To update a provider’s working hours, go to **Settings > Scheduling > Provider Hours**, select the clinician from the Provider dropdown, adjust the weekly start/end times or check **Day Off** for non‑working days, add any one‑time blocks with **Add Block**, then click **Save Changes**. Changes apply immediately to future slots. If the calendar still shows incorrect availability, clear your browser cache and verify there are no conflicting Facility Hours or time‑zone mismatches."
}
